<view class="page">
  <view class="header">
    <view class="title">发布传火信息</view>
    <view class="subtitle">选择你的身份、版本和通行证精灵，系统会按相同条件匹配对方。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="label">发布身份</view>
    <view class="chips">
      <view
        wx:for="{{roles}}"
        wx:key="value"
        class="chip {{role === item.value ? 'active' : ''}}"
        data-value="{{item.value}}"
        bindtap="onRoleChange"
      >
        {{item.label}}
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="label gap">通行证版本</view>
    <view class="chips">
      <view
        wx:for="{{passTypes}}"
        wx:key="value"
        class="chip {{passType === item.value ? 'active' : ''}}"
        data-value="{{item.value}}"
        bindtap="onPassTypeChange"
      >
        {{item.label}}
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="label gap">通行证精灵</view>
    <view class="chips">
      <view
        wx:for="{{pets}}"
        wx:key="value"
        class="chip {{petId === item.value ? 'active' : ''}}"
        data-value="{{item.value}}"
        bindtap="onPetChange"
      >
        {{item.label}}
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="label gap">备注</view>
    <textarea
      class="textarea"
      value="{{remark}}"
      maxlength="120"
      placeholder="例如：晚上在线、希望尽快联系、可接受的沟通方式等"
      bindinput="onRemarkInput"
    />
  </view>

  <view class="notice">
    平台只提供信息匹配，不参与现金交易。请双方自行确认身份、版本和精灵信息。
  </view>

  <button class="submit" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">确认发布</button>
</view>
